---

## Risk Summary

| Risk | Severity | Mitigation |
|---|---|---|
| Credentials exposed in chat | Critical | Rotate all keys immediately after audit |
| Render pipeline blocked | Critical | Wait for reset or upgrade plan |
| Chicken scan 502 on live | P1 | ONNX path, reduce image size, warm-up |
| Supabase egress still climbing | High | Billing cycle resets 04/30, R2 migration done |
| No STT for voice | Medium | Text-based parse works, STT is enhancement |
| R2 using dev URL | Medium | OK for beta, need custom domain for production |

---

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
```powershell
# Backend tests
dotnet test .\EatFitAI_v1.sln --no-restore --nologo --verbosity minimal

# AI provider tests
cd ai-provider && python -m pytest tests -q

# Mobile lint + typecheck
npm --prefix .\eatfitai-mobile run lint
npm --prefix .\eatfitai-mobile run typecheck

# Mobile Jest
npm --prefix .\eatfitai-mobile test
```

### Service Verification
```powershell
# Cloud smoke sequence
npm --prefix .\eatfitai-mobile run smoke:render:verify
npm --prefix .\eatfitai-mobile run smoke:preflight
npm --prefix .\eatfitai-mobile run smoke:auth:api
npm --prefix .\eatfitai-mobile run smoke:user:api
npm --prefix .\eatfitai-mobile run smoke:ai:api
```

### Manual Verification
- Supabase dashboard: egress metrics screenshot
- Cloudflare R2 dashboard: bucket objects, usage metrics
- Render dashboard: deploy status, health checks
- Real device: gallery scan beef/chicken, notification, full user journey

---

