1. **Phase 5C** - Live service verification (ngay lập tức, không cần code change)
2. **Phase 1A** - Supabase quota audit (dashboard check)
3. **Phase 2A+2B** - R2 bucket verification
4. **Phase 3B** - Gemini health check
5. **Phase 5D** - Fix `appsettings.Production.json`
6. **Phase 1B** - Add Supabase URL regression guard
7. **Phase 3A** - YOLO scan stabilization (nếu cần)
8. **Phase 4** - Voice decision + implementation
9. **Phase 5A** - Credential rotation (user action)
10. **Phase 5B** - Render deploy unblock (user action)
11. **Phase 5E** - Mobile build & real-device test (sau deploy)
